│ of 15) in association with these measures and effect sizes. These additional language versions of the I-QOL          │
│ instrument demonstrate psychometric properties similar to the original version. The I-QOL has shown good results in  │
│ both community studies and clinical trials with varying types and severity of urinary incontinence. It is a reliable │
